<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vietnamese Vibes — Sách tương tác</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Vietnamese Vibes 1–3 by Phan Trang and Chu Phong Lan (Cafoscarina, 2024): interactive Vietnamese books from Ca’ Foscari University of Venice.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Literata:ital,opsz,wght@0,7..72,500;0,7..72,600;1,7..72,400&display=swap&subset=vietnamese" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/unive/unive.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Ca’ Foscari University of Venice · Vietnamese</span>
      <h1>Vietnamese <em>Vibes</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Three interactive books for learning Vietnamese. Each one has readings, vocabulary cards, grammar notes, audio and practice.</p>
      <p class="byline">By <strong>Phan Trang</strong> &amp; <strong>Chu Phong Lan</strong> · Cafoscarina, 2024</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <ol class="books">
      {%- for b in vibes %}
      <li class="book">
        <div class="spine" aria-hidden="true">{{ b.n }}</div>
        <div class="body">
          <h2><a href="/unive/{{ b.slug }}/">{{ b.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="meta">Quyển {{ b.n }} · {{ b.lessons }} bài · {{ b.lessons }} lessons</p>
          <p>{{ b.blurb }}</p>
          <ul class="topics">
            {%- for t in b.topics %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn" href="/unive/{{ b.slug }}/">Đọc sách · Read</a>
            <a class="link" href="{{ b.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in new tab ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </main>

  <section class="wrap about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <h2 id="about-h">Về tác giả · About the author</h2>
    <p><strong>Dr. Trang Phan</strong> is an Assistant Professor of Vietnamese language and linguistics in the Department of Asian and North African Studies at Ca’ Foscari University of Venice. <em>Vietnamese Vibes</em> was written with <strong>Chu Phong Lan</strong> and published by Cafoscarina in 2024.</p>
  </section>

  <footer class="wrap foot">
    <a href="/">Open Vietnamese</a> · Free, open-access Vietnamese learning materials
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
